     "explanation": "This step operationalizes corroboration. Genuinely significant events generate an ecosystem of independent coverage — wire services, local reporters, official statements, eyewitness accounts. So you run a quick conditional: IF this were true and this big, THEN many independent outlets would report it. When you search and find the claim exists only on one obscure site (plus accounts recycling that same site), the consequent fails — and that silence is evidence of fabrication or distortion. Caution on two points: search rankings are not truth rankings (engagement and SEO drive them), and multiple outlets citing the SAME single origin is one source wearing ten hats, not corroboration — trace the chain back (Lesson 4's independence test).",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Why search the claim, not the post?</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"180\" width=\"900\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">THE CONDITIONAL TEST</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"285\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">IF true and significant →</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">independent outlets would carry it</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"360\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Real events leave coverage ecosystems</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"430\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">THE TELLING SILENCE</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"530\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">\"Huge story\" found only on one fringe site</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"565\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">+ accounts recycling that same site</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Absence of coverage IS the finding</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"660\" width=\"900\" height=\"190\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"710\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">TWO CAUTIONS</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"755\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Search rank ≠ truth rank (SEO, engagement)</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"795\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Ten outlets citing one origin = one source</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"825\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Trace the citation chain to its root</text>\n                    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"880\" width=\"700\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"935\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">THE PRINCIPLE</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"980\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Corroboration must be INDEPENDENT</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"1015\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Same origin in ten costumes doesn't count</text>\n                </svg>",
      "caption": "Significant + true = independently covered"
     }
